Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:01:50.04,0:01:53.05,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}There once was\Na man named Mont Blanc Noland.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:53.88,0:01:57.55,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}He was from a kingdom\Nin the Northern seas.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.55,0:01:59.84,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Noland, or "Noland the Explorer,"
Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.84,0:02:04.18,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}always told stories about\Nhis incredible adventures.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.18,0:02:06.41,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,They were so incredible\Nthat the villagers
Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.41,0:02:08.62,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,could never tell if\Nthey were true or not.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.32,0:02:15.87,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,One day, Noland returned from a long\Njourney to report to the king.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.33,0:02:19.34,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It stands proud and beautiful in ruin!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.34,0:02:22.02,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,The city is named Shandora!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.02,0:02:24.19,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,But they call it "The City of Gold,"
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.19,0:02:26.15,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,which describes it perfectly.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.46,0:02:33.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Marie Jois has finally granted us\Npermission to enter the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.93,0:02:37.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So I would like to send\Nyou on another mission.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.10,0:02:38.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It would be my pleasure.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.12,0:02:41.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There will be a slight change, however.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:41.29,0:02:43.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This time, my soldiers\Nand I will accompany you.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.60,0:02:46.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that understood?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.90,0:02:47.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.32,0:02:52.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kalgara!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.40,0:02:53.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seto.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.40,0:02:55.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're off to ring the bell, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.28,0:02:56.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll help you.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.22,0:03:01.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's good to see you too, Nola!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.57,0:03:04.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You sure have made yourself at\Nhome in these ruins, haven't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.37,0:03:10.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, when do you think Noland and\Nthe rest of his crew are coming back?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.80,0:03:14.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's all you ever ask\Nabout when we come here.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.29,0:03:17.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not exactly easy\Nfor him to return.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.30,0:03:20.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was born all the way\Nin the far northern seas.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.30,0:03:22.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He also has a family back home.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.31,0:03:24.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... he promised.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.44,0:03:27.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep ringing\Nthis bell the way we have been,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.65,0:03:30.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,he'll show up again someday.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.40,0:03:35.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's happened to the sky?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.02,0:03:36.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on, Seto!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.03,0:03:38.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to protect the village!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.43,0:04:03.64,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.27,0:04:07.81,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Why does the island suddenly end here?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.19,0:04:12.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Noland!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.40,0:04:14.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I cannot believe I ever\Ntrusted you. You liar!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.86,0:04:18.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where is the city of gold you\Npromised I would find here?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.74,0:04:20.53,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Where did the village go?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.06,0:04:23.85,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,What happened to the island?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.85,0:04:28.88,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Kalgara, if you're alive,\Nplease ring the golden bell!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.46,0:04:32.63,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Answer me, fire of Shandora!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.34,0:04:39.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Noland's public\Nexecution is about to start!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.88,0:04:42.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! It's this way, guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.31,0:04:43.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.18,0:04:48.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I saw a giant city of gold on\Nthe Grand Line island of Jaya.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.52,0:04:52.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The City of Gold\Ndoes exist, I assure you.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.22,0:04:54.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let us hear from one of your crew.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.83,0:04:57.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is this man telling the truth?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.11,0:05:01.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's not. It's an absolute lie.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.91,0:05:03.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! Please.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.07,0:05:04.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't trust anything that man says!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.99,0:05:06.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's a liar!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.33,0:05:08.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Were all his stories fake?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.00,0:05:09.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's not fair!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.41,0:05:12.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's been lying to the whole\Nkingdom and acting like a hero!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.34,0:05:14.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on!\NWhere'd you get that witness?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.09,0:05:15.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's not even part of our crew!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.30,0:05:18.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you happen to see\NKalgara and the others?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.59,0:05:21.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Commodore! What happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.31,0:05:22.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seize all of them!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.72,0:05:25.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.98,0:05:27.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leave my men alone.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.38,0:05:36.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}For his heinous lies, Mont Blanc Noland is\Nhereby sentenced to death by beheading!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.69,0:05:40.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.81,0:05:47.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Noland!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.84,0:05:55.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Liar! Liar!\N– Liar! Liar!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.26,0:05:58.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Liar! Liar!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.09,0:06:46.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look at that! A giant island of Vearth!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.83,0:06:48.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can you hear that?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.76,0:06:51.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The singing voice of\Nthis beautiful Vearth.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.47,0:06:54.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It is truly the birth of holy land.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.31,0:06:58.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is definitely where I must live.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.60,0:07:02.48,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.86,0:07:05.05,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.05,0:07:06.51,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Why can't I breathe?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.53,0:07:08.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is everybody all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.66,0:07:09.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pull yourselves together!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.78,0:07:11.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on, everyone! Get up!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.74,0:07:13.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tend to the wounded! Hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.10,0:07:15.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kalgara!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.41,0:07:19.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hereby claim this Vearth as mine!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.40,0:07:21.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You will call me God!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.25,0:07:23.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are not God!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.71,0:07:26.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shandorians, we fight!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.00,0:07:30.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We cannot let them take our land!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.38,0:07:34.76,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,We made a promise, Noland.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.76,0:07:37.39,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,We promised we would\Nmeet again someday.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.17,0:07:42.26,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Kalgara... where are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.51,0:07:47.64,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,When you finally return, what will\Nyou think when you see we're gone?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.03,0:07:51.62,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on a little longer!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.56,0:07:54.69,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll let you know\Nthat we're still here!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.16,0:07:57.45,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you alive?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.79,0:08:01.54,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I have so much to tell you!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.57,0:08:03.73,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Kalgara!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.73,0:08:05.82,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I have to know if you're all right!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.07,0:08:11.91,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's meet again\Non the same land one day!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.76,0:08:16.10,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Noland!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:16.10,0:08:19.13,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Light the fire of Shandora!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.13,0:08:22.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And the great Warrior\NKalgara continued to shout.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.72,0:08:25.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just once would've been enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.30,0:08:28.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But he believed that\Nthe Fire of Shandora
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.35,0:08:32.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,would echo and tell\Nthe world that we are here.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.14,0:08:34.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But the bell never rang once.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.65,0:08:38.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And then, everything was\Nexplained to our villagers.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.16,0:08:44.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Sailors from the Blue Sea told us\Nthat Noland, to whom we owe so much,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.80,0:08:49.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,had such pride for our city\Nthat he refused to deny
Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.10,0:08:53.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shandora's existence\Nand died known as a liar.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.72,0:08:58.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it was too late.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.48,0:09:04.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The great warrior Kalgara had died\Nhonorably in battle here in the sky.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.52,0:09:07.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was never able\Nto convey his message.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.36,0:09:11.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And that was the Great\NWarrior's biggest regret.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.61,0:09:13.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you think we'd\Nstill be able to reach him?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.21,0:09:17.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we rang the bell now, do you think\Nwe'd be able to still reach Noland?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.86,0:09:19.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me the truth!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.62,0:09:22.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's a good question.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.83,0:09:25.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, we are close to Heaven.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.09,0:09:29.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wyper! Come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.67,0:09:31.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll die if we don't leave now!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.12,0:09:36.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, Wyper!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.28,0:09:37.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.97,0:09:41.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What gives you the right to\Ntake away everything we know?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.94,0:09:48.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the sky! It is God's domain!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.65,0:09:51.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everything is an eyesore!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.36,0:09:55.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The people, the trees, the land!\NReturn to where you belong!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.66,0:09:58.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let everything rain into the Blue Sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.76,0:10:03.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get to the boats!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.04,0:10:06.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Angel Island won't last much longer!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.84,0:10:09.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sir, what do we do with the\Npeople who've been injured?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.51,0:10:11.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hurry! We'll treat them\Nonce they're in the boats.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.43,0:10:22.02,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,What would've happened if that\Ngirl had approached me any later?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.69,0:10:24.44,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope she's all right.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.09,0:10:40.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The little angels will\Nscurry like the ants they are!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.43,0:10:46.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Return to where you belong, Skypiea!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.71,0:10:51.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.11,0:10:53.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A hole in the White White Sea?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.90,0:10:58.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have no need for\NGod's Shrine anymore, either!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.37,0:11:05.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The city of Shandora\Nis useless to me as well!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.19,0:11:19.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There is only one thing\Nin this land that I want.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.04,0:11:23.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The gold belfry!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.12,0:11:28.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Suddenly I hear two voices.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.54,0:11:30.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How can he run so fast?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.37,0:11:32.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Nami.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.62,0:11:34.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of this I promise!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.62,0:11:37.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru! I'll never let you\Nhave the golden bell!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.39,0:11:51.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.39,0:11:53.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it that Eneru wants there?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.56,0:11:56.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I believe he's trying\Nto get to the golden bell.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.11,0:11:57.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A bell?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.39,0:11:59.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A golden bell.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.65,0:12:01.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.73,0:12:03.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's what you said, isn't it.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.31,0:12:04.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wyper!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.44,0:12:05.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.28,0:12:06.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh... uh...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.73,0:12:08.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who was talking about a golden bell?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.82,0:12:11.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just before you were\Nstruck by that lightning bolt,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.17,0:12:14.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you were speaking of a golden\Nbell which Eneru desires.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.81,0:12:19.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Now that we know what Eneru's going for,\Nyou have to tell me where it is.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.65,0:12:23.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mmm... Hold on, could we just think\Nabout this for one second, guys?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.81,0:12:25.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You saw that thunderbolt!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.02,0:12:28.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're as good as dead\Nif we don't get out of here!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.91,0:12:32.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's up this beanstalk.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.50,0:12:34.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Somewhere close to the top.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.42,0:12:36.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're sure? How do you know this?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.32,0:12:37.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.70,0:12:41.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We promised Nami that we'd\Nwait back on the ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.12,0:12:44.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's gonna be back\Nwith Luffy any time now!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:44.67,0:12:46.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sure!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.21,0:12:48.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The coward's right this time!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.79,0:12:51.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The ruins of Shandora are in\Nthe layer directly beneath us.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.92,0:12:55.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The giant beanstalk pierces\Nthe very center of the city.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.29,0:13:00.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.71,0:13:02.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These ruins or whatever\Nthey are got blasted to dust!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.42,0:13:07.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And if we don't get outta here\Nright now, we're gonna be next!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.88,0:13:10.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In the ruins, I\Ndiscovered a map that revealed
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.09,0:13:13.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the location of the grand belfry\Nthat holds the golden bell.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:13.26,0:13:16.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It indicated that it could be found\Nin the heart of the ancient city.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.47,0:13:18.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To put it simply,\Nthe force of the impact
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.77,0:13:22.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}with the vine must have sent the bell\Nhurling skyward to its present location.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.53,0:13:39.53,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.24,0:13:47.41,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,The City of Gold's got\Na really big bell in it, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.63,0:13:58.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Finally. I'm above Giant Jack.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.09,0:13:59.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Virgin sky.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.34,0:14:01.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I certainly never had\Nreason to come up here
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.43,0:14:04.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I doubt anyone else\Nhas either... now where is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.78,0:14:07.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After 400 years...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.98,0:14:10.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...it will be found.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.87,0:14:13.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The golden bell.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.68,0:14:35.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Him.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.94,0:14:40.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It would appear that I\Nunderestimated the little rat.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.48,0:14:43.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha! Gotcha!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.61,0:14:46.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stay right there!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.49,0:14:49.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.37,0:14:52.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Absurd.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.77,0:15:17.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, Wyper?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.10,0:15:18.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What're you planning to do?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.69,0:15:21.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're gonna\Nclimb the beanstalk!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.74,0:15:28.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone! Get away from the beanstalk!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.03,0:15:29.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Something's falling!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.88,0:15:38.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The top of the stalk!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.25,0:15:40.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's happening up there?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.88,0:15:42.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Don't tell me\NLuffy and Nami fell with it!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.97,0:15:44.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just don't think I could take it!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.59,0:15:45.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wyper!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.12,0:15:48.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! You can't go!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.91,0:15:50.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not in this condition!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.33,0:15:52.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look at yourself, you're a wreck!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.04,0:15:53.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'd never make it!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.42,0:15:57.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}And even if you did, there's no way to reach\NEneru while he's flying on that ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.21,0:16:00.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The bell. It's directly above us.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.26,0:16:07.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Great Warrior Kalgara\Nlonged to hear its sound.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.40,0:16:19.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This little predicament\Nwill make it very difficult
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.32,0:16:21.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,indeed for you to reach me, won't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.91,0:16:24.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You just wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.63,0:16:29.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hang around a little bit longer...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.76,0:16:33.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...and I'll show you\Nsomething miraculous.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.57,0:16:36.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Show you... something...?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.58,0:16:42.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is all that?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.80,0:16:47.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.30,0:16:49.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess I should get out of\Nthis while he's not around.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.48,0:17:23.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is he doing?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.03,0:17:31.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow. My plan totally worked!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.91,0:17:34.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, now's my chance\Nto get on board that ark!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.71,0:17:39.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.08,0:17:42.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here, Nami?\NI haven't rescued you yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.75,0:17:45.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I came to rescue you, you dolt!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.71,0:17:49.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji and Usopp saved me so I was\Nsafe down below this whole time.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.86,0:17:53.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really? You were? That's great.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.24,0:17:54.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was worried.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.97,0:17:56.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,More importantly...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.18,0:17:57.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.90,0:17:59.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.44,0:18:05.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The thunderclouds.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.90,0:18:07.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're changing shape.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.84,0:18:15.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– The sky! Save us!\N– The sky! Save us!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.38,0:18:17.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Somebody please help us!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.47,0:18:19.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The sky! It's pitch black!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:19.38,0:18:20.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.68,0:18:21.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.76,0:18:24.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Move it! Everyone to the sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.14,0:18:28.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's a giant\Nball floating in the sky!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.31,0:18:35.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have a bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.73,0:18:40.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That ball coming through the clouds\Nover there is a massive thunderhead.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.22,0:18:44.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}And it's bursting at the seams with\Nhurricane winds and deadly lightning bolts.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.37,0:19:00.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's right above... Angel Island!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.66,0:19:03.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A thundercloud shaped like a sphere.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.22,0:19:06.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Unreal...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.55,0:19:08.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This has got to be a nightmare.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.14,0:19:11.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.76,0:19:14.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What new horrors could he unleash next?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.25,0:19:21.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Get to the ocean!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.25,0:19:23.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.10,0:19:35.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now everyone will know\Nthat the skies are mine!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:37.56,0:19:41.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With the powers of the ark, Maxim,\Nand myself, I am unstoppable!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.98,0:19:45.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have become truly omnipotent!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.28,0:19:46.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.49,0:19:48.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's falling onto Angel Island!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.32,0:19:51.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's too late!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.83,0:19:53.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna make it!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.37,0:19:55.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Everybody run!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.59,0:20:37.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it. That's impossible!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.01,0:20:39.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did the White Berets escape?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.05,0:20:42.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The White Berets saved us all.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.06,0:20:45.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The entire island has been destroyed.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.35,0:20:47.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our precious homeland is gone forever!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.46,0:20:53.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even the sea clouds were obliterated.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.80,0:21:03.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a glorious sight to behold!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.87,0:21:06.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now this is what the\Nsky should look like.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.37,0:21:14.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wh-What kind of explosion was that?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.68,0:21:19.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not to mention, that terrible lightning\Nis still falling down like rain!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.27,0:21:22.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't think any of us stand\Na chance of getting out of here alive!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.90,0:21:25.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Angel Island's gone.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.44,0:21:27.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.32,0:21:28.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.99,0:21:32.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What cruelty.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.49,0:21:34.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What monstrous cruelty!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.61,0:21:42.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is that rumbling?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.12,0:21:44.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Suu! Suu...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.62,0:21:46.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll wait.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.54,0:21:49.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to take them back\Nsafely to the Blue Sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.00,0:21:52.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.04,0:21:54.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get on so we can get back down there!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.21,0:21:57.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone else is headed for\Nthe ship and we should be too!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.72,0:21:59.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.42,0:22:00.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can't? Why not?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.80,0:22:02.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:02.05,0:22:03.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you can.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.51,0:22:05.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't have to save\Nyou anymore, but...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.10,0:22:08.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I still have some unfinished business!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.72,0:22:11.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Unfinished business?\NWhat's left to do here?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.85,0:22:13.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to get back at Eneru?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.90,0:22:16.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That golden bell is somewhere\Nup there in the sky!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.20,0:22:20.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're after the bell? Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.00,0:22:22.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your life is more important than gold.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.54,0:22:23.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.92,0:22:25.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even if the lightning doesn't hurt you,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.91,0:22:30.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,he can still destroy you\Na thousand other ways!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:30.47,0:22:33.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If it's gold you want, you have\Na load of it on your arm!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:33.76,0:22:36.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So give up the bell, Luffy,\Nfor your own sake!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:38.30,0:22:40.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't die.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.24,0:22:44.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Will you quit it, already?\NYou know that he... You saw it, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.83,0:22:46.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Saw what?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:50.93,0:22:52.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The City of Gold.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.18,0:22:54.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know for a fact it exists, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.57,0:23:01.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then it wasn't a lie!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.13,0:23:04.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Old Timer's ancestor.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.28,0:23:10.91,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't care if I find the city or not.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:10.91,0:23:13.58,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not here to prove\NNoland right or wrong.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:13.58,0:23:16.83,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I have no interest\Nin rewriting history.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:16.83,0:23:20.29,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,All I'm doing is following\Nwhat I believe is my destiny.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.29,0:23:22.51,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,This is between me and Noland.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.51,0:23:23.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He wasn't a liar.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:26.68,0:23:30.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have to let Old Timer and\Nthe others down below know...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.72,0:23:35.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...that the City of Gold\Nis up in the sky!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.98,0:23:40.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I ring the bell...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:42.03,0:23:43.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...then they should be able to hear it.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.47,0:23:46.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, Old Timer\Nand his monkey pals
Dialogue: 50,0:23:46.56,0:23:49.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,will keep searching the ocean\Nfloor until the day they die!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:54.37,0:23:55.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:56.69,0:23:59.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru won't take the golden bell.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.49,0:24:04.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}The sound from a bell that huge will be\Nheard far and wide by people everywhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:05.73,0:24:09.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So I'm not stopping until I hear\Nthe sounds of the golden bell!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.05,0:24:15.89,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,The City of Gold's got\Na really big bell in it, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:18.60,0:24:21.41,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Noland did mention\Nthat in his logbook, yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:21.41,0:24:24.41,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,A great bell in the City of Gold.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.41,0:24:25.79,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Why do you ask, Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.79,0:24:27.62,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, why do you ask, Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.38,0:24:31.09,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I got a really good idea.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:32.67,0:24:34.93,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, tell me!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:34.93,0:24:37.80,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,If we give that ginormous\Nbell a good ringing,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:37.80,0:24:42.05,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I bet that Old Timer and those monkeys\Ndown below would hear it. Don'tcha think?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.47,0:24:47.39,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I bet they would.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.39,0:24:53.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When he says that he's\Ngonna do something, he does it.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:53.37,0:24:55.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait. He's gonna...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:56.35,0:24:58.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, he did say that.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:58.23,0:25:00.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But given the situation...
Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.79,0:25:05.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ring?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.61,0:25:07.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's going to ring the bell?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:08.21,0:25:09.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:09.09,0:25:14.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No matter how hard Nami tries, Luffy\Nwon't leave until he rings that bell.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:14.03,0:25:17.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see, Luffy is after\Nthe same thing as Eneru.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:27.28,0:25:28.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:32.28,0:25:36.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As captain of this ship, I do\Nnot give you permission to board.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:36.51,0:25:37.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:46.37,0:25:47.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.50,0:25:51.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See, I told you that was a bad idea!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:51.02,0:25:52.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn him!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:53.43,0:25:54.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wasn't it beautiful?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:54.89,0:25:59.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you get to see that pathetic\Nlittle island vanish from the sky?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:59.29,0:26:01.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can only assume\Nthat you are acquainted
Dialogue: 50,0:26:01.12,0:26:04.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with how forgiving I am, especially\Nto those who would deceive me.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:04.57,0:26:07.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Girl, would you still\Nlike a trip to Endless Vearth?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:07.37,0:26:08.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:08.66,0:26:12.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Once I have finally found the treasured\Nrelic I've been searching for,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:12.05,0:26:14.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will use another\Ndevastating Raigo to annihilate
Dialogue: 50,0:26:14.80,0:26:17.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the rest of this abominable\Nisland in the sky!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:17.54,0:26:21.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then every inhabitant of Skypiea\Nwill suffer my terrible wrath!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:25.89,0:26:30.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All will perish, including\Nthe voices directly beneath you.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:30.47,0:26:32.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Beneath us?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:32.02,0:26:37.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will eradicate this unnatural\Nland in the sky once and for all!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:37.30,0:26:41.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will change everything back\Nto the way it was intended!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:42.87,0:26:47.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That... is my sacred\Nduty as Eneru Almighty!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.51,0:26:55.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let that happen!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:55.72,0:26:59.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You won't get away with this!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:06.90,0:27:09.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your time ends now, rubber boy!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.53,0:27:12.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Die with dignity!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:15.95,0:27:16.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:23.96,0:27:24.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:28.63,0:27:30.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Face it.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:30.26,0:27:32.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's beyond anyone's\Npower to stop me now.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:37.31,0:27:40.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru...!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:40.19,0:27:42.73,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen, everything will be all right.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:42.73,0:27:45.03,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I promise. We will send you to the sky.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:51.73,0:27:53.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 50,0:27:55.95,0:27:58.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.19,0:28:05.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...ring that bell!
